---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Essential Apps & Resources for Burgas - Eurovision 2027">
	<div class="container essential-container">
		<h1 class="page-title text-gradient">Burgas Survival Guide: Essential Apps & Resources</h1>
		<p class="subtitle">
			Navigating a new city during a massive event like Eurovision requires the right tools. From public transport to ordering a taxi or paying road tolls, here are the essential apps you need to download before arriving in Bulgaria.
		</p>

				<div class="apps-grid">
			<!-- Transport Apps -->
			<div class="glass-panel app-card">
				<h2>🚍 Public Transport</h2>
				<ul>
					<li><strong>Moovit:</strong> The most reliable app for Burgas bus routes, schedules, and live tracking. A must-have for getting to Arena Burgas.</li>
					<li><strong>Transport Burgas:</strong> The official municipal app (sometimes spotty, but good for official route maps and purchasing digital tickets).</li>
				</ul>
			</div>

			<!-- Taxi Apps -->
			<div class="glass-panel app-card">
				<h2>🚕 Taxis & Ride Hailing</h2>
				<ul>
					<li><strong>Yellow! & Green Taxi:</strong> Some of the most professional and modern taxi fleets in Bulgaria. Yellow! is especially essential if you are landing in Sofia first and need a reliable airport transfer.</li>
					<li><strong>Maxim / TaxiMe:</strong> Uber is NOT available in Bulgaria. These are the closest local equivalents for ordering reliable, metered taxis.</li>
					<li><strong>Omega Taxi:</strong> One of the most reputable local taxi companies directly in Burgas with their own ordering app.</li>
				</ul>
			</div>

			<!-- Driving -->
			<div class="glass-panel app-card">
				<h2>🚗 Driving & Navigation</h2>
				<ul>
					<li><strong>Waze:</strong> The absolute #1 navigation app in Bulgaria. Locals rely heavily on it for real-time traffic updates, police trap alerts, and road hazard warnings.</li>
					<li><strong>BGTOLL (bgtoll.bg):</strong> If you rent a car or drive into Bulgaria, you MUST buy an electronic vignette. Do it officially via this site/app to avoid massive fines.</li>
					<li><strong>myVe:</strong> A very useful digital assistant for your vehicle in Bulgaria. Helps you check for traffic fines, track vignette validity, and find nearby services.</li>
					<li><strong>Fuelio:</strong> Great for road-trippers to track fuel prices across different gas stations in Bulgaria and manage mileage.</li>
					<li><strong>Burgas Parking:</strong> For paying the "Blue Zone" and "Green Zone" street parking fees via SMS or card in the city center.</li>
				</ul>
			</div>

			<!-- Lifestyle & Delivery -->
			<div class="glass-panel app-card">
				<h2>🍕 Lifestyle, Food & Deals</h2>
				<ul>
					<li><strong>Grabo (grabo.bg):</strong> The Bulgarian equivalent of Groupon. Essential for snagging huge discounts on SPA days, local excursions, restaurants, and beauty services.</li>
					<li><strong>Glovo:</strong> Excellent for fast food, groceries, and pharmacy deliveries straight to your hotel or Airbnb.</li>
					<li><strong>Happy Delivery:</strong> The legendary Bulgarian restaurant chain (Happy Bar & Grill) has its own app for massive portions of comfort food.</li>
				</ul>
			</div>

			<!-- Finance & Payments -->
			<div class="glass-panel app-card" style="border-color: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.4);">
				<h2>💳 Finance & Travel Cards</h2>
				<ul>
					<li>
						<strong>Revolut:</strong> The absolute best way to avoid crazy banking fees and bad exchange rates (especially if you're coming from the UK, Scandinavia, or outside the Eurozone). Pay anywhere like a local and easily split restaurant bills with your friends.
						<br/><br/>
						<a href="https://revolut.com/referral/?referral-code=elena02b5!AUG1-26-AR-LL&geo-redirect" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary" style="padding: 8px 16px; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-top: 8px;">
							Get Revolut Card
						</a>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- Newsletter Lead Magnet -->
		<div class="newsletter-cta glass-panel">
			<div class="newsletter-content">
				<h2>Want the Full PDF Survival Guide?</h2>
				<p>
					We are preparing a massive, printable 20-page <strong>Burgas 2027 Eurovision Survival Guide</strong> (including offline maps, emergency numbers, and insider local tips). Drop your email below and we'll send it to you as soon as it's published!
				</p>
				<form class="subscribe-form" action="https://formsubmit.co/delenav1974@gmail.com" method="POST">
					<input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Enter your email address" required>
					<input type="hidden" name="_next" value="https://burgas2027guide.com/essential-apps">
					<input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Survival Guide Request!">
					<button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Send me the Guide</button>
				</form>
				<p class="spam-notice">No spam. You can unsubscribe at any time.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	.essential-container {
		padding-top: 48px;
		padding-bottom: 64px;
		max-width: 1000px;
	}

	.page-title {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		text-align: center;
		margin-bottom: 16px;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 1px;
	}

	.subtitle {
		text-align: center;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 0 auto 48px;
		line-height: 1.8;
	}

	.apps-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(350px, 1fr));
		gap: 24px;
		margin-bottom: 48px;
	}

	.app-card {
		padding: 32px;
	}

	.app-card h2 {
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 24px;
		color: var(--text-main);
	}

	.app-card ul {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
	}

	.app-card li {
		margin-bottom: 16px;
		line-height: 1.6;
		color: var(--text-muted);
	}

	.app-card li strong {
		color: var(--accent-amber);
		display: block;
		margin-bottom: 4px;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
	}

	.newsletter-cta {
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.1), rgba(255, 0, 122, 0.1));
		border: 1px solid rgba(255, 0, 122, 0.3);
		text-align: center;
		padding: 48px 32px;
		border-radius: 24px;
	}

	.newsletter-content {
		max-width: 700px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.newsletter-content h2 {
		font-size: 2rem;
		margin-bottom: 16px;
		color: var(--text-main);
	}

	.newsletter-content p {
		margin-bottom: 32px;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
	}

	.subscribe-form {
		display: flex;
		gap: 16px;
		justify-content: center;
		margin-bottom: 16px;
	}

	.subscribe-form input {
		flex: 1;
		max-width: 400px;
		padding: 16px 24px;
		border-radius: 8px;
		border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
		background: rgba(11, 15, 25, 0.8);
		color: var(--text-main);
		font-size: 1rem;
		outline: none;
		transition: all 0.2s;
	}

	.subscribe-form input:focus {
		border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
		box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.2);
	}

	.subscribe-form button {
		padding: 16px 32px;
		font-size: 1rem;
	}

	.spam-notice {
		font-size: 0.85rem !important;
		opacity: 0.7;
		margin-bottom: 0 !important;
	}

	@media (max-width: 600px) {
		.subscribe-form {
			flex-direction: column;
		}
		
		.subscribe-form input {
			max-width: 100%;
		}
	}
</style>

